            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uwo Ezira aradūga ava i Babuloni; kandi yar’ umunyabgenge w’ivyanditswe kandi w’umuhanga mu vy’ivyagezwe vya Mose vyatanzwe n’ Uhoraho Imana y’Abisirayeli. Umwami amuha ivyo yamusavye vyose, abiheshwa n’ikiganza c’ Uhoraho Imana yiwe cari kuri we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
