              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.8.1+EZR.8.2+EZR.8.3+EZR.8.4+EZR.8.5+EZR.8.6+EZR.8.7+EZR.8.8+EZR.8.9+EZR.8.10+EZR.8.11+EZR.8.12+EZR.8.13+EZR.8.14+EZR.8.15+EZR.8.16+EZR.8.17+EZR.8.18+EZR.8.19+EZR.8.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8:1-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bamwe mu Bisirayeli badūgana n’abaherezi bamwe n’ Abalewi n’abaririmvyi b’abashibamyi n’abahawe ibango ry’ibikorwa vy’urusengero; abo baja i Yerusalemu mu mwaka ugira indwi Aritazeruzi ari ku ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Ezira ashika i Yerusalemu mu kwezi kwa gatanu kwo mu mwaka ugira indwi nyene uwo mwami ari ku ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yari yahagurutse ava i Babuloni ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kwa mbere, maz’ ashika i Yerusalemu ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kwa gatanu, abihawe n’ikiganza ciza c’Imana cari kuri we; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
