        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ibizosāguka kur’ ayo mafeza n’amazahabu, mwe na bagenzi banyu muze mubikoreshe uko mubona bikwiye, mukurikiye ivyo Imana yanyu igomba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kand’ ibintu vy’imbombovu uhawe vyo gukoresha mu ngoro y’Imana yawe, uz’ ubishikirize iyo Mana y’i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ibintu vyose ingoro y’ Imana yawe izokenera, ivyo uzoba ukwiye gutanga, uz’ uhore ubikūra mu nzu ibīkwamw’ ibintu vyanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.7.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 7:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi jewe umwami Aritazeruzi, mbariye abazezwabintu banje bose bo hakurya y’ uruzi, ku vya Ezira umuherezi, umwanditsi w’ivyagezwe vy’Imana Nyen’ ijuru, yukw ivy’ azobāka vyose bizohora bitanganwa umwete, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bikagarukira kw italanto z’ ifeza ijana, n’ingero zitwa koro z’ingano ijana, n’imibindi ya vino ijana, n’imibindi y’amavuta ijana nyene, n’umunyu utarinze kugerwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ic’ Imana Nyen’ ijuru izokwaka cose kize gihore kigirirwa ingoro yayo bidatevye, kugira ng’ uburake bgayo ntibube ku gihugu canje n’abahungu banje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
