                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nawe Ezira, nk’uk’ ubgenge bg’ Imana buri muri wewe, uz’ utore abashingantahe n’abacamanza bo gucīra imanza abantu bose bo hakurya y’uruzi, abazi ivyagezwe vy’Imana yawe bose; n’ūtabizi muze muhore mubimwigisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ūtazokwumvira ivyagezwe vy’Imana yawe n’ivyagezwe vyanje umwami, baze bagire umwete wo kumucīra urubanza, ar’ urwo kwicwa, cank’ urwo gucibga, cank’ urwo kunyagwa ivyiwe, cank’ urwo kubohwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
